      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T15:48:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe a more readable way is to use `AtomicReference` and mutate it after the filter is instantiated:\n```\n    AtomicReference\u003cRunnable\u003e builderRef \u003d new AtomicReference\u003c\u003e();\n    ConcurrentBloomFilter\u003cInteger\u003e b \u003d\n        new ConcurrentBloomFilter\u003c\u003e(Funnels.integerFunnel(), () -\u003e builderRef.get().run());\n    builderRef.set(() -\u003e builder.accept(b));\n    return b;\n```",
      "revId": "624a600b096530ce89fd1653488b94cfc841b7b9",
